---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support Fate Apothecary">
  <section class="about-page shell">
    <div class="about-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support Fate Apothecary</p>
      <h1>Help keep the apothecary growing.</h1>
      <p class="about-lede">The resources here are meant to stay freely available. If Fate Apothecary has helped you cook something delicious, grow something useful, or learn something new, you’ll eventually be able to support the project here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>We’re still setting up the official support link. For now, consider this page reserved for future coffee-funding, garden-fueling, recipe-testing, and general encouragement.</p>
      <p class="about-note">Once the Buy Me a Coffee link is ready, this page can become a simple landing spot — or the nav link can go straight there instead.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
